  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/moradabad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Moradabad</a>: <a href=\"/tag/max+lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Max Lab</a>, the <a href=\"/tag/diagnostic+services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">diagnostic services</a> arm of Max Healthcare, has opened a new laboratory in Moradabad, expanding its presence in Uttar Pradesh.The new facility is equipped with advanced diagnostic technology ranging from routine pathology investigations to specialised tests, including advanced genomics and oncology diagnostics, the diagnostic firm said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Arpan Malhotra, Director and COO, Max Lab, said, “The expansion of our diagnostic network in Moradabad is an important step towards making quality and advanced diagnostic services more accessible to people in <a href=\"/tag/tier+ii+cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tier II cities</a>. Diagnostics play a pivotal role in healthcare, with a significant proportion of clinical decisions guided by test results. As awareness around preventive healthcare increases and the burden of chronic diseases continues to grow, access to timely, accurate and reliable testing becomes even more important.”</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The expansion aims to cater to the growing demand for reliable diagnostic services in Tier II cities to strengthen access to quality diagnostic services in emerging healthcare markets, it added.With the new expansion, Max Lab has a presence in over 60 cities and a network of over 1,700 patient touchpoints.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 13, 2026 at 02:13 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 13, 2026 at 02:13 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsl